4. Optional Commercial Imagery Providers (User Opt-In Only)
-----------------------------------------------------------
ButterSat does not redistribute any aerial or satellite imagery. Outside open
regional coverage, the daemon does not fetch from commercial imagery services
unless the user explicitly accepts the provider notice in Settings:

  * Esri World Imagery (`esri`):
    "Imagery © Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics, and the GIS User Community"
    (Esri Master Agreement / ArcGIS Online Terms of Use).

  * Bing Maps Aerial (`bing`):
    "Imagery © Microsoft Bing Maps (Maxar, Earthstar Geographics, Vexcel)"
    (Microsoft Bing Maps Platform APIs Terms of Use).


5. Flight Plan Route Prefetch
-----------------------------
  * SimBrief (`simbrief.com`):
    Optional route prefetch retrieves the user's latest Operational Flight Plan
    (OFP) via SimBrief's `xml.fetcher.php` endpoint on explicit user request.
    Flight plan data provided by SimBrief / Navigraph (https://www.simbrief.com).


